        "id": 1265562
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-08T20:34:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would that look like? A modification to writevars() so that commit isn\u0027t necessarily called, leaving out writevars() and setting g_updateNV to TRUE, etc.?",
      "parentUuid": "f9482628_0b560590",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 755,
        "startChar": 3,
